# Scratch space for agent/manual verification runs inside a worktree: throwaway SQLite DBs, app
# logs, pristine file copies kept for mutation-proof restores, and one-off helper scripts. Never
# part of the source tree — the existing *.db / logs/ rules cover some of it, but not all.
_sandbox/
